DESCRIPTION:Hi all\,\n\nWe have a court reservation for a private group pic
 kleball event on Thursday\, May 4th. @Miggy Mendoza<mailto:miggy85@stanford
 .edu> please inform the front desk staff and have them create signage that 
 the court will be offline. The lesson will happen in the first hour (5:45-6
 :45pm) and they have the full court reserved for two hours (5:45-7:45pm). T
 hey did not request custodial services nor catering\, and indicated they wo
 uld only provide water to attendees. Let me know if you have any questions.
 \n\nBest\,\nNina\n
