DESCRIPTION:<br>Hi David\, <br>For the DCI pickleball group on Saturday Oct
 . 14<sup>th</sup> 10-12noon located at Stanford Outdoor Courts\, I want to 
 try a suggestion you made regarding you bringing the equipment. The group r
 eserved 16 paddles and 8 pickleballs.  On Thursday Oct. 12<sup>th</sup> aft
 er your REC classes\, I can have the equipment ready for you to take for th
 is rental. OR if you prefer to pick up in the morning on your way to the re
 ntal\, I can have the equipment ready at our front desk. After the rental i
 s over\, I told Dianne (Contact Person)\, the group may keep the equipment 
 and return to Redwood City\, or you can bring it back. <br><br>Please let m
 e know which option you prefer for picking up equipment and if you have any
  questions. <br><br>Thank you\, <br><br><br><br><p dir="ltr"><b>Ryan Samuel
 s (He/Him/His) </b></p><p dir="ltr">Assistant General Manager | Stanford Re
 dwood City Recreation and Wellness</p><p dir="ltr">Department of Athletics\
 , Physical Education\, and Recreation</p><p dir="ltr">(O) 650.421.6150</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230928T162602Z
LOCATION:West Campus Tennis Courts\, 188 Electioneer Wy\, Stanford\, CA 943
 05\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Stanford event
TRANSP:OPAQUE
